@startuml
!theme plain
title TASK-260712-2hcq1g - History and Receipt Query Boundaries

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Pulsar app" as App
actor "Verified Telegram user" as Bot

component "HTTP history routes" as HTTP
component "Common authorized\nhistory service" as History
database "ActorContext +\ncurrent bindings" as Identity
database "Media repository" as Media
database "Transmission +\nfrozen targets" as Tx
database "DND/block policy" as Policy
database "Digest-only cursor state" as Cursor

App --> HTTP : bearer
HTTP --> History
Bot --> History : verified Telegram identity
History --> Identity : resolve current actor scope
History --> Media : processing/ready/error/content
History --> Tx : accepted order + exact receipts
History --> Policy : current action hints\nblocked-reason ownership
History --> Cursor : 24 h actor/scope-bound page

note bottom
  History is read-only. It does not create replay,
  offline inbox, target state, or authorization.
  Mutations always reauthorize in their owning service.
end note

@enduml
